                                                "example_id": "5b552c31-e13c-41ca-8204-81206bcc7858",
                                                "sense_id": "d2393fe0-8c50-3f68-a9ac-6d52054943b2",
                                                "text": "It was a great success, that Irish stew. I don’t think I ever enjoyed a meal more. There was something so fresh and piquant about it. One's palate gets so tired of the old hackneyed things: here was a dish with a new flavour, with a taste like nothing else on earth."
